{
  "title": "After 100,000 Years of Training in a Super Difficult Dungeon, I Became the World's Strongest ~The Weakest Incompetent Gains the Upper Hand~",
  "description": "“The Most Incompetent in the World.” Kai Heineman received this gift at the age of 13. However, its effects resulted in his drastically reduced physical abilities. Shunned by a society that values Gifts above all else, Kai was forced to leave his country. While on his journey, he accidentally wandered into a dungeon that triggered the \"Trial of the Gods\"… not knowing what awaits him there?\nThus begins the exhilarating, unstoppable fantasy of a boy once deemed incompetent, now rising to greatness!",
  "artist": "Hizuki Asuka",
  "author": "Riki Sui",
